Adaptation_method:
Refactor any code using partial application with async.applyEach. For example, replace:

// Before (partial application):
const runFns = async.applyEach(fns);
runFns(arg1, arg2, cb);

// After (no partial application):
async.applyEach(fns, arg1, arg2, cb);
// Or, for promise usage:
await async.applyEach(fns, arg1, arg2);

If partial application is needed, use a wrapper:
const runFns = (a1, a2, cb) => async.applyEach(fns, a1, a2, cb);
